ng", "id": "28237211759206795", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314657_28237211769206794_2487406901153220099_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U_gOmRMqBkQQ7kNvwGo8wM3&_nc_oc=AdoTHsAXM1mqXbsM8iXpfa1RtbjatgWvsQCBwiDVO54eOFl8JGD1GCuT2RJLYCNvbkI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE72N7lNVuqHnO1sLmAnXR2_8-vpKwX0AD6zikM1liPmQ&oe=6A95BC0A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "nullhypothesis-dystopia-trailer.png", "id": "1529136821824905", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293825_1529136825158238_2004190547615515794_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=48yXrcoDhUEQ7kNvwGYG5Hh&_nc_oc=AdrQ-JlOTyrn2oYP5tv3Mjj1gAJVn7IlfjdlBUOl-Ebdgly8pDYksTfp26vv4Inc2qA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFAxTdpnL4RIeCCVA_D0GiOFZibG8Gl7JQBzVqrSTAnrQ&oe=6A95D9F8"}, "display_name": "Dystopia", "keywords": ["free", "new", "games", "arcade", "music"], "long_description": "Dystopia is a free VR rhythm game where you slice glowing crystals to the beat of the music as they fly towards you. With a blade in each hand, cut each crystal the way its arrow points.\n\n# Live radio you slice\nFive stations, always on. Every song is made on the spot for its premiere, plays exactly once, and everyone tuned to your station is slicing it at the same moment. Hear one you love? Save it to your Archive to replay it as it aired.\n\n# Discover your sound\n- **Mental:** metal and rock where the riffs never die\n- **Pulse:** EDM and club, the bass line is your heartbeat\n- **Drift:** lo-fi and chill, your calm in the chaos\n- **Volt:** industrial synth and electronic, no off switch\n- **Wave:** pop and dance, catchy hooks all day\n\n# Your world rises with your play\nPlay well and the 3D cinematic world around you keeps building. Miss and it crumbles. The laser show rides the beat, and every cut counts towards unlocking your next world.\n\n**Easy to Insane:** five difficulty levels, from an easy first cruise to Insane patterns that earn a real sweat. Post your best run to the leaderboards.\n\n**Station DJs:** every station has its own host with intros, reactions, banter, even the weather.\n\n**Rare golden crystal:** slice it when it drops and step into another reality: Comic, Noir, and more.\n\nBuilt for Meta Quest 3 and Meta Quest 3S.\n\nWelcome to Dystopia. Slice responsibly.", "short_description": "Dystopia is a free VR rhythm game where you slice glowing crystals to the beat of the music as they fly towards you. With a blade in each hand, cut each crystal the way its arrow points.\n\nLive radio, five stations, always on. Every song is made on the spot and plays exactly once. Hear one you love? Save it to your Archive to replay it as it aired. Play well and the world around you keeps building. Miss and it crumbles. Go from Easy to Insane and unlock new worlds as you slice."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nullhypothesis.inc/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nullhypothesis.inc/terms", "publisher_name": "Null Hypothesis Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://nullhypothesis.inc/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1250028628199032"}, "review_messages": []}]}